            <title>[IGNITE-10509] Rollback exception instead of timeout exception</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10509</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Looks like we have race on changing transaction state between timedOut and state set&lt;br/&gt;
